   "source": ["---\n", "## Ejercicio 5: Type Hints Avanzados\n", "\n", "**Concepto:** Python soporta anotaciones de tipo (PEP 484+) que no afectan runtime pero permiten verificación estática con mypy. Los generics (`TypeVar`) permiten funciones polimórficas tipadas.\n", "\n", "**Herramientas:** `TypeVar`, `Protocol`, `ParamSpec`, `Annotated`, `overload`."],
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": ["from typing import TypeVar, Protocol\n", "\n", "T = TypeVar('T')\n", "\n", "# Protocol — structural subtyping (no herencia nominal)\n", "class Drawable(Protocol):\n", "    def draw(self) -> str: ...\n", "\n", "class Circulo:\n", "    def draw(self) -> str:\n", "        return \"○\"\n", "\n", "def render(shape: Drawable) -> None:\n", "    print(shape.draw())  # Funciona con cualquier clase que tenga draw()\n", "\n", "render(Circulo())  # OK: Circulo tiene draw()"]
